  "term": "pleasure",
  "definition": "Pleasure is a rewarding positive experience that can motivate behavior. In this source, it is described as arising through interacting cognitive, psychological, bodily, and social processes, such as enjoyment from how events are processed, immersive engagement, movement or synchronization, and social connection.",
